MiatOff AA-touch stick
======================

aa-touch.sh, AATOUCH.ID and oem-aa-mod/libpatch.conf
  Part of MiatOff. GPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE).
  The USB launcher (the *.up file name and its ZIP), the root remount and
  watchdog handling and the SafeReboot request follow TouchTune 1.2.1 by Miatafy
  (GPL-3.0-or-later), https://github.com/Miatafy/TouchTune

touchtune/
  The complete, unmodified TouchTune 1.2.1 release by Miatafy (GPL-3.0-or-later),
  with its own LICENSE, NOTICE and SOURCE.txt. aa-touch.sh only starts its
  install-patches.sh when step 1 is chosen in the dialog.

miatoff-app/
  MiatOff Meters (the HMI app, the gauges page, the collector, the userscript).
  Part of MiatOff, GPL-3.0-or-later. The userscript's idea (adding an item to
  Applications by borrowing a disabled app) comes from MZD-AIO's
  additionalApps.js (GPL-3.0), https://github.com/Trevelopment/MZD-AIO
  The fonts in miatoff-app/app/meters/fonts/ are unmodified files from
  google/fonts under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, with their license texts:
    ChakraPetch-Bold.ttf       (OFL-ChakraPetch.txt)
    ShareTechMono-Regular.ttf  (OFL-ShareTechMono.txt)
    Rajdhani-Bold.ttf          (OFL-Rajdhani.txt)
    RussoOne-Regular.ttf       (OFL-RussoOne.txt)

images/safety/
  The blank reversing-camera safety text image from MZD-AIO by Trevelopment
  (GPL-3.0), https://github.com/Trevelopment/MZD-AIO, unmodified
  (app/files/tweaks/config/safety-warning-reverse-camera/), once per SafetyText
  image name of the unit.

images/sensors/
  Semi-transparent parking sensor images from MZD-AIO by Trevelopment (GPL-3.0),
  https://github.com/Trevelopment/MZD-AIO, unmodified
  (app/files/tweaks/config/transparent-parking-sensor/).

